{"parse": {"title": "衣着/另一个夏日", "pageid": 69121, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"character-skin-page\"><div class=\"character-base-info\"><div class=\"character-img-box0 tabber\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div class=\"character-img-box1\"><div class=\"tabber-item hide-m\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"Skin_bg-304603.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit-height\" style=\"position:absolute; right:0; height:100%;display:none;\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2\"><img alt=\"Zhujiemian you di.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bc/Zhujiemian_you_di.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"508\" height=\"612\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" data-file-width=\"508\" data-file-height=\"612\" /></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-id=\"304603\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-tabberimg=\"Portrait-304603.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:Portrait-304603.webp\"></div><div class=\"character-img-box2 tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-tabberimg=\"L2d_static-304603_cng_p.webp\" data-tabberimgclass=\"img-fit\" data-tabberimglink=\"File:L2d_static-304603_cng_p.webp\" style=\"display:none;\"></div></div><div class=\"character-desc-offset\"><div class=\"character-img-button-group\"><div class=\"tabber-filter l2d-button-group\"><div class=\"l2d-button\"><img alt=\"Btm lihui.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/4d/Btm_lihui.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"84\" data-file-height=\"84\" /></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"0\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" data-type=\"isl2d\">L2D</div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-isl2d=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-isl2d=\"0\" data-type=\"isl2d\">立绘</div></div></div></div><div class=\"img-desc img-desc-only\" style=\"position:relative; padding-bottom:25px\">她鼓足勇气，再一次挑战，这次她要抓住阳光与泡沫。</div><div class=\"character-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-304603 cng.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/3/30/Spine_static-304603_cng.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"236\" height=\"463\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"236\" data-file-height=\"463\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3046\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%B5%E9%97%B9%E9%AC%BC\" title=\"吵闹鬼\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%B5%E9%97%B9%E9%AC%BC\" title=\"吵闹鬼\"><img alt=\"吵闹鬼\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-304601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-304601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%90%B5%E9%97%B9%E9%AC%BC\" title=\"吵闹鬼\">吵闹鬼</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>2.2</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>保利斯塔纳热浪</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304603</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">1月21日，科帕卡巴纳，人很多<br />我……不喜欢夏天，也不喜欢海滩……总有很多漂亮的女孩在海滩上玩闹。看到她们，我就会想到自己脸上的雀斑、有些弯曲的膝盖。不行，我得用床单把它们裹得再严实些……<br /><br />2月3日，阴天，人依然很多<br />新的床单！嗯……也许是沙滩浴巾？它有些短了，也许遮不住那条腿……但这里为什么会有一条沙滩浴巾？是……谁送给我的吗？但是这样的图案，有些太引人注目了……<br /><br />2月9日，晴，直到凌晨，人们才离开了海滩<br />披上了那条浴巾之后，就好像……我也是那些女孩里的一员一样，这……很新奇。<br />潮水偶尔会碰到我的那条腿，它在水中变得很柔软。我想它也许喜欢这种湿漉漉的感觉……要不要做一次更大胆的尝试……？</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304603\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304604.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1c/Belonging-304604.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\"><div class=\"line-1\">彩色被单\n</div><div class=\"line-2\">（假日海岸款）</div><div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Patterned Sheet (Summer Beach)</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />10<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>以巴西海岸为主题的彩色被单，沙滩与海洋交织成一片夏日的剪影，原本是为无法造访海滩的孩子们而准备。<br />受访者似乎抱着很大的决心才做出如此令人出乎意料的选择。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304605.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/9f/Belonging-304605.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">入门级潜泳镜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Beginner's Diving Mask</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />0.2<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>勉强可用的塑料潜泳镜，标示的价格远高于实际成本，当地摊贩们面向观光客的主力推销商品之一。<br />并非每一趟旅程都能尽如人意，在有限的条件下，她已做到最好。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304606.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1f/Belonging-304606.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">60年代潮流贴纸<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Vintage 60s Stickers</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>曾经风靡校园的小玩意，一度成为了女孩们的第二流通货币。<br />显然受访者的潮流触觉依旧停留在某个夏日，但无关紧要——至少它们与新被单相得益彰。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A51.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 另一个夏日1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A51.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A51.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A51.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A51.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A51.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A51.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A52.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 另一个夏日2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A52.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A52.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A52.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A52.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dc/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A52.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E5%8F%A6%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%A4%8F%E6%97%A52.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">另一个夏日 <small style=\"color: grey\">Under a Different Sea</small></span></span>"}}